// A contract call that gives the contract a shielded coin, as a local chain
// (mn-l9-verify) took it on 2026-11-12: the probe contract's
// `lock(coin: ShieldedCoinInfo)`, which does `receiveShielded(disclose(coin))`,
// called with a fresh coin of 3 shielded NIGHT. Three transactions of it: the
// call as midnight-js handed it to be proven (what mn serve prices), the
// shielded wallet's balancing of it (an input spending the wallet's coin and
// an output for the change, unproven), and the transaction the chain took,
// read back from its indexer, proofs, Dust spend and all.

/** The call, unproven: what mn serve's price is asked for. */
export const COIN_CALL_UNPROVEN_HEX = '';

/** The shielded wallet's balancing of the call, unproven: the zswap offer that pays the coin from the wallet's own. */
export const COIN_CALL_SHIELDED_BALANCING_HEX = '';

/** The call as the chain took it: the dApp's part proven, with the wallet's shielded balancing and Dust spend. */
export const COIN_CALL_LANDED_HEX = '';
